<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/eng@/~chp_II__cl_15__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) Where a dividend is paid, credited or distributed, whether in monetary form or otherwise, by a company to any of its shareholders which is an individual, either through direct shareholding or a nominee, and the dividend is deemed by virtue of section 14 to be derived from Malaysia, the company shall, upon paying, crediting or distributing the dividend, furnish the shareholders with a certificate setting forth in respect of the dividend— (a) the gross amount; and (b) the amount paid or credited or where the dividend consists of property other than money, the amount of the market value of that property at the time of the distribution of the dividend.”. Amendment of Schedule 1"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/48/eng@> .
